* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
* SUBPROGRAM: SUBVALCP
* SYSTEM:   SIFAP - PAYMENT INSPECTION AND ADMINISTRATION SYSTEM
* AUTHOR:   MARCIA HELENA OLIVEIRA
* DATE:     12/03/1998
* CHANGED:  17/05/2005 - MARCIA HELENA  - ADJUST CPF VALIDATION
* CHANGED:  07/06/2011 - ROBERTO MENDES - USE CCVALCPF
* PURPOSE:  CPF VALIDATION SUBPROGRAM - MODULUS 11.
*           SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH FOR CPF IN SIFAP.
*           DOES NOT INPUT OR WRITE - RETURNS EVERYTHING VIA PDA.
*
* INVOCATION:
*   CALLNAT 'SUBVALCP' #PV-TYPE-DOC #PV-CPF #PV-NIS
*                      #PV-COD-RETURN #PV-MSG
*                      #PV-IND-SPECIAL
*
* PRECONDITION:
*   #PV-TYPE-DOC = 'C'
*   #PV-CPF      = CPF WITH 11 POSITIONS, LEFT-PADDED WITH ZEROS
*
* POSTCONDITION:
*   #PV-COD-RETURN = 0 WHEN THE CPF IS VALID
*
* NOTE:     PARAMETER #PV-NIS IS NOT USED HERE. THE PDA IS
*           SHARED WITH SUBVALNI PER INTERNAL STANDARD
*           (NT-SUPDE-011/1998). DO NOT REMOVE IT FROM THE LIST.
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
DEFINE DATA
PARAMETER USING PDAVALID
LOCAL
  1 #CPF-STR             (A11)
  1 #CPF-OK              (L)
  1 #CPF-DIG             (N1/1:11)
  1 #CPF-SUM             (N5)
  1 #CPF-QUOT            (N5)
  1 #CPF-REMAIN          (N2)
  1 #CPF-DV1             (N1)
  1 #CPF-DV2             (N1)
  1 #CPF-WEIGHT          (N2)
  1 #CPF-IDX             (N2)
  1 #CPF-EQUAL           (L)
END-DEFINE
*
RESET #PV-COD-RETURN #PV-MSG
MOVE 'N' TO #PV-IND-SPECIAL
*
* ============================================
* INPUT PARAMETER CONSISTENCY
* ============================================
IF #PV-TYPE-DOC NE 'C'
  MOVE 1004 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
  MOVE 'INVALID DOCUMENT TYPE FOR SUBVALCP' TO #PV-MSG
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
IF #PV-CPF = ' ' OR #PV-CPF = '00000000000'
  MOVE 1002 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
  MOVE 'CPF NOT PROVIDED' TO #PV-MSG
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
IF #PV-CPF NE MASK(NNNNNNNNNNN)
  MOVE 1005 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
  MOVE 'CPF CONTAINS NONNUMERIC CHARACTER' TO #PV-MSG
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
* ============================================
* MODULUS 11 VALIDATION - STANDARD ROUTINE
* ============================================
MOVE #PV-CPF TO #CPF-STR
PERFORM VALID-CPF-STANDARD
*
IF NOT #CPF-OK
  MOVE 1001 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
  MOVE 'INVALID CPF - CHECK DIGIT' TO #PV-MSG
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-IF
*
* VALID CPF
MOVE 0 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
RESET #PV-MSG
*
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
ON ERROR
  MOVE 9999 TO #PV-COD-RETURN
  COMPRESS 'NATURAL ERROR' *ERROR-NR
           'LINE' *ERROR-LINE
           'PGM' *PROGRAM INTO #PV-MSG
  ESCAPE ROUTINE
END-ERROR
*
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
INCLUDE CCVALCPF
*
END
